        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/01/apple-music-free-logo.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>As <a href=\"https://x.com/aaronp613/status/2060534790663573566\">spotted</a> by Aaron Perris, Apple seems to be working on different subscription tiers to <a href=\"https://apple.co/45qdAoX\">Apple Music</a>, based on strings found in the beta version of the platform’s Android app. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-music\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053869\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-music-could-soon-get-different-subscription-tiers/#more-1053869\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
