        "title": "Apple spotlights Detroit app makers as local Developer Academy marks fifth graduating class",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-spotlights-detroit-app-makers-as-local-developer-academy-marks-fifth-graduating-class/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/detroit-developer-academy.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p>Apple today marked the fifth graduating class from its Detroit Developer Academy with a new feature highlighting local app makers who have used the program over the years to build apps, businesses, and community projects. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"app-store,apple-developer-academy\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053858\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-spotlights-detroit-app-makers-as-local-developer-academy-marks-fifth-graduating-class/#more-1053858\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
