        "title": "Apple Music outage confirmed in multiple countries [U: Fixed]",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-music-outage-confirmed-in-multiple-countries/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2025/09/apple-music-app-icon-ios-26.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p><strong>Update, 9:17 p.m. ET:</strong> Apple’s System Status page now marks the partial outage as resolved. The original post follows below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Apple’s System Status pages in several countries are showing an ongoing <a href=\"https://apple.co/45qdAoX\">Apple Music</a> disruption. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-music\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053850\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/29/apple-music-outage-confirmed-in-multiple-countries/#more-1053850\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
