        "title": "The darkness of a Tasmanian town's night sky could be protected",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213361/The-darkness-of-a-Tasmanian-towns-night-sky-could-be-protected",
        "content_text": "The darkness of a Tasmanian town's night sky could be protected. <a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-05-17/tasmania-ross-dark-sky-accreditation-tourism/106620330\">The northern Tasmanian town of Ross is working to protect its night sky, a years-long process that would see it formally recognised for its darkness and clarity.</a> (Australia)",
